Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:04:27.00,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 WTA500 新加坡 女单第一轮
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:04:27.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}王欣瑜 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}1 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}2{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 维基奇 · 赛后转播商专访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Hi Xinyu, congratulations on the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,欣瑜 恭喜你赢球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:06.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I think earlier on you expressed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:06.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我记得你之前说过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.68,0:00:09.16,EN,,0,0,0,,obviously some respect for your opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.68,0:00:09.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你很尊重这位对手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:10.04,EN,,0,0,0,,She's a good opponent,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.16,0:00:10.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,她是个很好的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:12.20,EN,,0,0,0,,but the score was 6-1, 6-2.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.04,0:00:12.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,但比分是 6-1 6-2
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:13.40,EN,,0,0,0,,You must be,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:13.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,你一定
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:15.96,EN,,0,0,0,,very happy with the outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,对这个结果很满意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:16.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:16.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:19.40,EN,,0,0,0,,we've played once in Cincinnati this year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:19.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,今年我们在辛辛那提交过手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:21.96,EN,,0,0,0,,and it was a tough tough match out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:21.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,那一场打得非常非常艰苦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:25.00,EN,,0,0,0,,And I know she can play unbelievable
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:25.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道她能打得极具侵略性
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:26.76,EN,,0,0,0,,aggressive and I know she can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:26.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,也知道她
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:29.32,EN,,0,0,0,,hit some amazing winners,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:29.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,能打出惊人的制胜分
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:31.24,EN,,0,0,0,,but today I think I'm really happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:31.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,但今天我真的很满意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:31.96,EN,,0,0,0,,with the level
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:31.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己的水准
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.96,0:00:33.88,EN,,0,0,0,,that I showed from the beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.96,0:00:33.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,从这场球一开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:35.56,EN,,0,0,0,,of the match until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.88,0:00:35.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,到结束都保持住了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.56,0:00:38.28,EN,,0,0,0,,And I think it was I would say it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.56,0:00:38.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我会说这
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.28,0:00:40.52,EN,,0,0,0,,was very clean match and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.28,0:00:40.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,是一场很干净的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:44.20,EN,,0,0,0,,because I really served well, returned well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:44.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我发球好 接发也好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:47.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and I took the time away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.20,0:00:47.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且我压缩了她的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.32,0:00:51.96,EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, it was a really good match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.32,0:00:51.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这场球真的不错
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:52.84,EN,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:52.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,确实如此
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:53.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Right from the start,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.84,0:00:53.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,从一开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:55.64,EN,,0,0,0,,you did look like you were very calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.72,0:00:55.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,你看上去就非常沉稳
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.64,0:00:58.04,EN,,0,0,0,,You had strong serve, delicate
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.64,0:00:58.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,发球很有威力 触球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:00:59.80,EN,,0,0,0,,when you touched and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:00:59.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,又很细腻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:00.52,EN,,0,0,0,,that must have put you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.80,0:01:00.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一定让你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:01.80,EN,,0,0,0,,in a very good head space already
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.52,0:01:01.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,很早就进入了很好的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.80,0:01:03.48,EN,,0,0,0,,from the getgo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.80,0:01:03.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,一上来就是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:07.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I would say it's the the work I put
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:07.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想这是我下的功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.32,0:01:10.84,EN,,0,0,0,,in like not just for this tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.32,0:01:10.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,不只是为了这一站
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:12.52,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, it's it's something
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:12.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,而是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.52,0:01:16.52,EN,,0,0,0,,that I've been doing throughout the year
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.52,0:01:16.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我这一年一直在做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:18.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and yeah, just working
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.52,0:01:18.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是一直在练
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.68,0:01:21.64,EN,,0,0,0,,on taking the time away from my opponent
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.68,0:01:21.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,怎么压缩对手的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.64,0:01:24.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and maximise, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.64,0:01:24.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有就是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.68,0:01:26.20,EN,,0,0,0,,my aggressiveness on court.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.68,0:01:26.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,把场上的侵略性发挥到最大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.20,0:01:26.76,EN,,0,0,0,,So I think
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.20,0:01:26.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.76,0:01:30.60,EN,,0,0,0,,from the beginning I was really sure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.76,0:01:30.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,从一开始我就很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:33.08,EN,,0,0,0,,of what I want to do on court like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.60,0:01:33.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,自己在场上要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.08,0:01:36.76,EN,,0,0,0,,not to just you know react
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.08,0:01:36.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,不是只做出反应
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:38.44,EN,,0,0,0,,on the shots she gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:38.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,去接她打过来的球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.44,0:01:39.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Instead I was really trying
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.44,0:01:39.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,而是真的在努力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:43.72,EN,,0,0,0,,to compose my game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:43.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,把自己的节奏组织起来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.72,0:01:44.92,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.72,0:01:44.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:46.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It seemed like you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:46.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,看起来你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.28,0:01:47.64,EN,,0,0,0,,were obviously serving well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.28,0:01:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,发球确实很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.64,0:01:50.36,EN,,0,0,0,,finding your spots well, but also especially I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.64,0:01:50.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,落点也找得很准
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:51.72,EN,,0,0,0,,think returning really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:51.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我觉得接发尤其好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:53.64,EN,,0,0,0,,like it seems like you're reading
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.72,0:01:53.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,看上去你能读出
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.64,0:01:55.96,EN,,0,0,0,,her her serve and and not giving her time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.64,0:01:55.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,她的发球 完全不给她时间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:57.72,EN,,0,0,0,,at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:57.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,一点都不给
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.72,0:02:01.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I mean she's a big server,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.72,0:02:01.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 她发球很强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.48,0:02:02.60,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.48,0:02:02.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个大家都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:05.00,EN,,0,0,0,,And I also I think
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:05.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,另外我想
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:08.68,EN,,0,0,0,,because I know for me it's always important
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:08.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说一直很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:11.16,EN,,0,0,0,,to attack their second serves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:11.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是去攻击对手的二发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.16,0:02:13.40,EN,,0,0,0,,And I guess I kind of put pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.16,0:02:13.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想我就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:14.84,EN,,0,0,0,,on her in that way
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.40,0:02:14.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,给了她压力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.84,0:02:18.68,EN,,0,0,0,,so that you know maybe she's putting one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.84,0:02:18.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,也许她的一发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:20.68,EN,,0,0,0,,or two less first serve
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:20.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,就少进了一两个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.68,0:02:23.32,EN,,0,0,0,,in and then you know I I took the chance
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.68,0:02:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后我抓住了机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.32,0:02:25.88,EN,,0,0,0,,and then I got one or two breaks in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.32,0:02:25.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后拿到了一两个破发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:27.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:27.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:29.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Now you seem very comfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.00,0:02:29.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你现在看起来很放松
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:30.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm wondering if if that's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:30.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在想这是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:32.20,EN,,0,0,0,,because you just like Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:32.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为你就是喜欢新加坡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.20,0:02:33.48,EN,,0,0,0,,You were here last year already
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.20,0:02:33.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,去年你就来过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.48,0:02:35.16,EN,,0,0,0,,and you did pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.48,0:02:35.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且打得相当不错
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.16,0:02:36.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.16,0:02:36.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 确实
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.12,0:02:38.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I I made it to the semi-final last time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.12,0:02:38.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,上次我打进了半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:41.24,EN,,0,0,0,,and for to the doubles final
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.68,0:02:41.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,双打还进了决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:43.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and it's just the the crowd here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:43.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且这里的观众
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.80,0:02:45.08,EN,,0,0,0,,they are they're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.80,0:02:45.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们真的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:47.32,EN,,0,0,0,,They're so cute. Like there is one lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:47.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,特别可爱 有一位女士
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.32,0:02:48.12,EN,,0,0,0,,she keeps coming
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.32,0:02:48.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,她一直来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.12,0:02:50.12,EN,,0,0,0,,to my match like not only in Singapore,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.12,0:02:50.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,看我的比赛 不只在新加坡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:52.20,EN,,0,0,0,,but I kept seeing her around the world
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:52.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在世界各地都遇到她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.20,0:02:57.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and she goes like I mean that's so cute
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.20,0:02:57.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,她就这样 真的太可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:02:58.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm just Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.40,0:02:58.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.52,0:03:00.20,EN,,0,0,0,,really happy to be back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.52,0:03:00.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的很高兴能回到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.20,0:03:01.96,EN,,0,0,0,,You know who she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.20,0:03:01.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道她是谁吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.96,0:03:06.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Yes. I mean not not like no no but I know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.96,0:03:06.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,算知道 也不算 但我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.28,0:03:08.60,EN,,0,0,0,,because I think she knows one
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.28,0:03:08.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为她认识
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:10.84,EN,,0,0,0,,of my friend because my friend she used
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:10.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的一个朋友 我那个朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.84,0:03:11.80,EN,,0,0,0,,to live in Singapore
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.84,0:03:11.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,以前住在新加坡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:14.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and then you know they know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:14.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,她们俩就这么认识了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:16.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay. Up next you're going to be playing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:16.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 下一轮你要对上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.52,EN,,0,0,0,,against Joanna Garland.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.68,0:03:18.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,葛蓝乔安娜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.52,0:03:21.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Is she an opponent you're familiar with?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.52,0:03:21.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个对手你熟悉吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:24.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh okay. yeah I mean I
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.40,0:03:24.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:26.60,EN,,0,0,0,,we played juniors together
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:26.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们青少年时期交过手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:29.16,EN,,0,0,0,,but yeah we didn't play each other
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.60,0:03:29.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,但那之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.16,0:03:30.52,EN,,0,0,0,,after that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.16,0:03:30.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,就没怎么再碰过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.52,0:03:31.48,EN,,0,0,0,,And I know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.52,0:03:31.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:33.80,EN,,0,0,0,,that she she was in the final
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:33.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,她打进过决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.80,0:03:37.48,EN,,0,0,0,,of that One Point Slam earlier in the year,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.80,0:03:37.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是年初那个一分制表演赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:38.60,EN,,0,0,0,,but yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:38.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.60,0:03:41.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean I would try to focus on on my game
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.60,0:03:41.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我会专注在自己的比赛上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.56,0:03:45.32,EN,,0,0,0,,and try to play as aggressive as I did today
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.56,0:03:45.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,争取打得像今天一样有侵略性
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.32,0:03:46.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and you know no matter what
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.32,0:03:46.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,不管
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.92,0:03:48.28,EN,,0,0,0,,the results going to be, I know
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.92,0:03:48.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,结果如何 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:50.68,EN,,0,0,0,,that I'm going to enjoy my match here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:50.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我会享受在这里的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.68,0:03:52.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.68,0:03:52.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:53.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Do you have a favorite thing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:53.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,有没有什么是你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:55.72,EN,,0,0,0,,about Singapore from last time
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:55.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,上次来新加坡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.72,0:03:57.00,EN,,0,0,0,,that you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.72,0:03:57.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,最喜欢的？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:04:03.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I think it's the the multicultural
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:04:03.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想是这里的多元文化
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:05.16,EN,,0,0,0,,because you know here they have lot
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:05.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为这里有很多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.16,0:04:07.88,EN,,0,0,0,,of Chinese and also especially they have lot
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.16,0:04:07.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,华人 尤其是有很多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:12.52,EN,,0,0,0,,of people from Guangdong or Hokkien
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:12.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,广东和福建来的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.52,0:04:14.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm from Shenzhen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.52,0:04:14.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,而我来自深圳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:17.48,EN,,0,0,0,,So that's in that case it's very similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:17.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以感觉非常相似
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.48,0:04:20.52,EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah it's kind of like home for me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.48,0:04:20.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说这里有点像家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:21.32,EN,,0,0,0,,to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:21.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,待在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.32,0:04:23.88,EN,,0,0,0,,So I'm really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.32,0:04:23.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我真的很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:24.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:24.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:25.64,EN,,0,0,0,,So thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:25.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:28.42,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Thank you guys for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:28.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢大家为我做的一切
